13e).<\/b><\/p><p><custom-table id=\"custom-table_0\"><\/custom-table><\/p>"],"globalTypesConfigs":[{"type":"gap","widthMode":"asLongestWord","longestAlternativeSolutions":false,"ignoreCaseSensitivity":false}],"staticText":{"text":"<p><b>Build your potential | Listening for details<\/b><\/p><p>When you listen for details, you want to know a specific piece of information, for example a name, a date, a job, an object, a place or a number.\u2022 Think about what type of information you want to know before you listen.Look at the questions to help you.\u2022 Predict the words that you might hear. For example, if you want to find out the age of a person, you could listen for the words <em>how old<\/em> or <em>years<\/em>.<\/p>","backgroundColor":"rgba(169,245,233,0.26)","isSet":true}}]}